window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>A mother killed. Her sons accused. Only one person knows the truth.</b><br> <br> LAPD Homicide Detective Marcy Kendrick is feeling the heat. Struggling to recover from the recent murder of her lover, she also has to deal with ex-husband Jordan, now her boss, who seems determined to make her life as difficult as possible.<br> <br> And Jordan is piling on the pressure thanks to a string of Marcy's cases going cold. She needs a win—and fast. Then heiress Audrina Dixon is brutally killed with only her fourteen-year-old twin sons as witnesses. But the boys, traumatized by what they have seen, seem to have developed a rare form of mutism.<br> <br> Or perhaps there's another reason they won't speak? Because soon there is mounting evidence that the boys themselves may be the killers.<br> <br> As Marcy deepens her investigation, she begins to realize that Audrina's murder is just one part of a much bigger picture. Behind it, lies a horrifying web of mind control, depravity, and revenge . . .<br> <br> A web spun by a powerful enemy who is willing to do whatever it takes to stop her—permanently.<br> <br> Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
